(Admin CRM Audit Report) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date: 2026-07-29) Tj
T*
(Scope: Admin access only) Tj
T*
(Modules audited: Dashboard, Notifications, Users, Items, Leads, Prospects, Quotations,) Tj
T*
(Customers, Reports, Profile, Settings, Help) Tj
T*
(Audit method: Static code and architecture review of frontend, backend, route guards, Prisma) Tj
T*
(models, validation schemas, service logic, subscription gates, and UI flows.) Tj
