T*
(- KPI names do not fully encode business definitions.) Tj
T*
(- Trend and performance logic was optimized for fast delivery, not large datasets.) Tj
T*
(- Frontend chart styling bypasses theme tokens.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Best-practice solution:) Tj
T*
(- Rename KPIs or update calculations:) Tj
T*
